            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A system comprising a catheter and a control system. One or more processors of the control system perform: receiving a set of model points of a model of one or more passageways of a patient; determining a state of the catheter while the catheter is positioned within the one or more passageways of the patient; when the state of the catheter satisfies a condition, collecting a set of measured points from within the one or more passageways, each point comprising coordinates within a surgical environment occupied by the patient; and generating a registration between the set of measured points and the set of model points.</p>
            </abstract>
